            "visually_inspected": true,
            "notes": "Two ellipsoidal state/Fourier spaces connected by dashed embedding arrow; orbit in latent space and red generalization trajectory, with an embedded quadruped illustration. Faithful reconstruction must preserve the orbit geometry and math labels."
          }
